  "description": "This mod adds compatibility to open Backpacks from Traveler's Backpack to Vivecraft/QuestCraft!",
  "body": "This mod fixes the issues with opening backpacks between Traveler's Backpack and Vivecraft/QuestCraft.\n\nJust replace the \"Open backpack\" key in your radial menu with the \"[VR] Open backpack\" keybind and voila, it works!\n\nIf you encounter any problems with this mod or it isn't working like it should, feel free to open up an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/VRealmsMC/VivecraftTBCompat/issues)!\n",
